      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68c90d5b00000000120307d0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u6",
      "unit_position": 6,
      "raw_text": "6. 你们这套系统是不是完全照 Prometheus 做的？那 AlertManager那套为啥没用？是不是有些场景不太适配？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
