      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68c90d5b00000000120307d0:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-24:u8",
      "unit_position": 8,
      "raw_text": "8.整个链路这么复杂，自己有没有做监控？要是这套监控系统自己挂了你们咋办？",
      "extraction_status": "extracted"
    },
